{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/gsap/timeline/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"timeline\" style=\"position:relative;\">timeline<a href=\"#timeline\" aria-label=\"timeline permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>타임라인은 <code class=\"language-text\">gsap.timeline()</code>으로 생성됩니다.<br>\n타임라인은 모든 트윈을 자연스럽게 순서대로 재생처리합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">timeline</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.sun'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">50</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">50</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.gress'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">stagger</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.bird'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.music'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"1-시각적-효과---position-parameter\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 시각적 효과 - Position Parameter<a href=\"#1-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%81%EC%A0%81-%ED%9A%A8%EA%B3%BC---position-parameter\" aria-label=\"1 시각적 효과   position parameter permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> tl <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">timeline</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>object<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">300</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"+=1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// 이전 트윈 종료 후 1초 뒤에 시작</span>\r\n  tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>object<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">300</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"-=1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// 이전 트윈 종료 1초 전에 시작</span>\r\n  tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>object<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property property\">rotation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">90</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// 이전 트윈 시작될 때 동시에 실행</span>\r\n  tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>object<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">0.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 이전 트윈 시작 된 후 1초 뒤에 실행</span>\r\n  tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>object2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 타임라인 1초에 실행</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - basic timeline\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/xxeqKmO?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/xxeqKmO\">\r\n  GSAP3 - basic timeline</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"2-타임라인의-컨트롤과-라벨링\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 타임라인의 컨트롤과 라벨링<a href=\"#2-%ED%83%80%EC%9E%84%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%98-%EC%BB%A8%ED%8A%B8%EB%A1%A4%EA%B3%BC-%EB%9D%BC%EB%B2%A8%EB%A7%81\" aria-label=\"2 타임라인의 컨트롤과 라벨링 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>GSAP은 타임라인에도 트윈과 동일하게 애니메이션을 제어할 수 있는 방법을 제공합니다. <code class=\"language-text\">ex) play()</code><br>\nLabel을 사용하면 타임라인에서 특정 지점으로 이동할 수 있습니다.<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">add()</code> 메서드를 사용하여 타임라인에 Label을 추가할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Timeline Control\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/gOymOpd?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/gOymOpd\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Timeline Control</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"3-메뉴-효과\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 메뉴 효과<a href=\"#3-%EB%A9%94%EB%89%B4-%ED%9A%A8%EA%B3%BC\" aria-label=\"3 메뉴 효과 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>GSAP을 사용하여 paused된 애니메이션 객체(Tween or Timeline)를 생성합니다.<br>\nJavascript의 Mouse Event를 사용해 (mouseenter, mouseleave) 애니메이션 객체에 <code class=\"language-text\">play()</code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">reverse()</code>를 적용합니다.</p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Menu Hover Effects (Multiple - Start)\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/KKYWwVW?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/KKYWwVW\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Menu Hover Effects (Multiple - Start)</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"4-hover-pulse-animation-버그-해결\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. Hover Pulse Animation, 버그 해결<a href=\"#4-hover-pulse-animation-%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"4 hover pulse animation 버그 해결 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>부드럽게 멈추거나 다시 반복되는 애니메이션의 대한 이슈는 GreenSock 포럼과 Stackoverflow에 굉장히 자주 등장하는 주제입니다.</p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Hover Pulse Animation (Started)\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/JjVWobe?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/JjVWobe\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Hover Pulse Animation (Started)</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h4 id=\"focu\" style=\"position:relative;\">FOCU<a href=\"#focu\" aria-label=\"focu permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>Flash of Un-styled Content (FOUC) 는 스타일이 지정되어 있지 않은 요소들이 화면에 랜더링 될 경우 콘텐츠의 깜빡이는 플래시 효과를 나타내는 용어 입니다.</p>\n<p>가장 일반적으로 웹폰트가 로드되기 전에 페이지 렌더링 상태에서 기본 글꼴이 나오고 적용된 웹폰트로 변경되는 모습을 상상하시면 됩니다.</p>\n<p>사용자에게 가장 빠른 로딩 경험을 제공 하기 위해 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;body></code> 태그 끝나기 전에 사용자 정의 스크립트를 로드하는 것이 좋고 또는 defer 명령어를 사용하는 것도 좋은 방법중 하나 입니다.</p>\n<p>하지만 우리 수업에서는 GSAP과 Javascript를 사용하여 FOUC를 제거해봅니다.</p>\n<p>FOUC를 피하기 위한 단계별 수행 항목</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GSAP의 Special 속성인 <code class=\"language-text\">autoAlpha : 1</code> 설정</li>\n<li>애니메이션 코드를 init() 함수로 래핑</li>\n<li>로드 이벤트 리스너를 사용하여 페이지가 로드 된 후 init() 함수를 호출</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"timeline을-활용한-예제-1\" style=\"position:relative;\">timeline을 활용한 예제 1<a href=\"#timeline%EC%9D%84-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-1\" aria-label=\"timeline을 활용한 예제 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><del>이미지 로딩시간이 좀 길다.</del></p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - 예제1\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/bGJqpXO?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/bGJqpXO\">\r\n  GSAP3 - 예제1</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"timeline을-활용한-예제-2\" style=\"position:relative;\">timeline을 활용한 예제 2<a href=\"#timeline%EC%9D%84-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-2\" aria-label=\"timeline을 활용한 예제 2 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>FOUC현상을 해결하기 위해 autoAlpha 속성을 사용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">tl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.stage'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">autoAlpha</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>codepen 에서는 유료 멤버십 기능인 <code class=\"language-text\">GSDevTools.create()</code> 를 사용할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Final Project (Start)\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/yLrMyRK?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/yLrMyRK\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Final Project (Start)</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#timeline\">timeline</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%81%EC%A0%81-%ED%9A%A8%EA%B3%BC---position-parameter\">1. 시각적 효과 - Position Parameter</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-%ED%83%80%EC%9E%84%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%98-%EC%BB%A8%ED%8A%B8%EB%A1%A4%EA%B3%BC-%EB%9D%BC%EB%B2%A8%EB%A7%81\">2. 타임라인의 컨트롤과 라벨링</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#3-%EB%A9%94%EB%89%B4-%ED%9A%A8%EA%B3%BC\">3. 메뉴 효과</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#4-hover-pulse-animation-%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\">4. Hover Pulse Animation, 버그 해결</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#focu\">FOCU</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#timeline%EC%9D%84-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-1\">timeline을 활용한 예제 1</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#timeline%EC%9D%84-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-2\">timeline을 활용한 예제 2</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"timeline","summary":"timeline 타임라인은 gsap.timeline()으로 생성됩니다. 타임라인은 모든 트윈을 자연스럽게 순서대로 재생처리합니다. gsap.timeline() .from(\".sun\", { duration: 1, opacity: 0, x: 50, y: 50 }) .from(\".gress\", { duration: 1, opacity: 0, y: 100,","date":"Mar 20, 2024","categories":["GSAP"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/timeline/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/tween_stagger_timeline/","title":"tween, stagger, timeline"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/keyframes/","title":"keyframes"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}